  "bodyHash": "f75c8640e70f4609",
  "content": "\n\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>本模组通过添加一些作弊物品与工具，让你的《我的世界》生活变得越来越轻松。</strong></span></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>视频（日语）</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UnnDu1cVH-g?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><em>物品</em></span></h2>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>切割板</em></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/604/cutting-board-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\">简单模式</span></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/605/cutting-board-recipe-easy.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在配置文件中设定放大倍率来合成物品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">将工作台替换为熔炉或酿造台，即可制作对应版本的熔炉或酿造台。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/606/crafting.png\" width=\"352\" height=\"332\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/607/furnace.png\" width=\"352\" height=\"332\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/608/brewing.png\" width=\"352\" height=\"332\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>挂钩</em></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/609/hook-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可将切割板悬挂于墙壁上。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">木质、石质、铁质、金质、钻石、翡翠及红石版本可保持设定的放大倍率恒定。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>便携切割板</em></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/610/portable-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由切割板与挂钩合成。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">右键使用。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>切割板母板</em></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/611/source-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"248\"></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可通过冶炼切割板获得。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可增加使用该物品进行合成的产出数量。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/612/source-example1.png\" width=\"352\" height=\"332\"></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/613/source-example2.png\" width=\"352\" height=\"332\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>切割板工具</em></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/614/sword-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">剑：以无限伤害攻击敌人。潜行状态下击杀敌人掉落物数量增加。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/615/paxel-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">十字镐斧（Paxel）：整合了所有工具（斧头、镐子、铲子与剑）。潜行状态下破坏方块或击杀敌人的掉落物数量增加。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按设置键（默认C）打开图形界面即可更改相关设置。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/629/configgui.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"352\" height=\"332\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>切割板弓</em></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可在末地城宝箱中获取。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>切割板护甲</em></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/616/helmet-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">头盔：提供夜视效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">胸甲：允许飞行。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">护腿：提供隐身效果。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">靴子：辅助移动。可提升移速并增加跳跃高度。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按设置键（默认C）打开图形界面即可更改相关设置。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>切割板盾牌</em></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">格挡时可使周围弹射物消失，并使自身进入无敌状态。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em>切割板戒指（需Baubles模组）</em></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/627/ring-recipe.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">按下设置键（默认C）可打开其图形界面。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若想更改工具或护甲设置，请按住Shift键并按下该键。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><em>按键设置</em></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/617/key.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1540\" height=\"394\"></span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Always（始终）：若“Always Manaita”选项已开启，按下此键无需手持任何物品即可打开图形界面。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">切割板：打开工具设置图形界面或戒指图形界面。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><em>配置说明</em></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/267/618/config.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"952\" height=\"504\"></em></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Doubling（倍增）：设置物品的放大倍率。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Always Manaita：启用常驻快捷操作功能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">EasyMode（简单模式）：简化切割板的合成配方。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
